            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "FlashySake7771"
            },
            "reviewBody": "First I had to mix by hand and they were very dry an crumbly. I rolled into balls, rolled in sesame seeds, and flattened with a flat cup. I had to wet the balls before rolling in seeds. I made the balls large. I have made arrowroot cookies before and could not find that recipe. I will look harder for the first recipe. I think that this calls fo too much flour.",
            "datePublished": "2023-09-26T21:48:48.725Z"
          },
